-## Conda
-
-For `conda` and `mamba` users.
-
-### Nightly
-
-```bash
-conda install -c conda-forge \
-  -c https://conda.modular.com/max-nightly/ [max / mojo]
-```
-
-### Stable
-
-```bash
-conda install -c conda-forge \
-  -c https://conda.modular.com/max/ [max / mojo]
-```
